+## Board Publication
+
+A published board can be viewed by anyone with its `public_url`, without signing in. The `public_url` is `null` while the board is not published. Only account administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`. Publishing a board that is already published keeps its existing `public_url`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board, so its `public_url` stops working. Publishing it again generates a new `public_url`.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8c93f65
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,112 @@
+require "test_helper"
+
+class Boards::PublicationsControllerTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
+  setup do
+    sign_in_as :kevin
+    @board = boards(:writebook)
+  end
+
+  test "publish" do
+    assert_difference -> { Board::Publication.count }, +1 do
+      post board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "publish as JSON returns the board with its public URL" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert_equal @board.id, @response.parsed_body["id"]
+    assert_equal public_board_url(@board.reload.publication.key), @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "publish again keeps the existing public URL" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    public_url = @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+    assert_no_difference -> { Board::Publication.count } do
+      post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    end
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert_equal public_url, @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "unpublish" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    assert_difference -> { Board::Publication.count }, -1 do
+      delete board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "unpublish as JSON" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
